Subject: [PATCH] docs: BUILDING - the compiler's bin first on PATH, or the
 Vulkan build dies at the shader step

Measured on a fresh clone of this export, following BUILDING.md exactly in Git Bash: the Vulkan build failed with `FAILED: [code=3221225785] ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan-shaders.hpp`. 3221225785 is 0xC0000139. vulkan-shaders-gen.exe is built as a separate CMake sub-project, so the static-runtime linker flags never reach it, and it runs mid-build against the first libstdc++-6.dll on PATH - which in Git Bash is Git for Windows' own. The CPU-only build runs no such helper and built fine. Section 2 now carries the one-line PATH rule, and the troubleshooting table the exact failure line.

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - release documentation for this fork; no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED - documents only; no code path is touched.
